stays small.

Free per-cycle leaves, by block:

* sources and guards: the unit/line/stream/pointer/host-mailbox outputs and the
  synchronised pin levels (`fl`, `pins_level`, `acc_a`, `acc_r`, `sh_d`, `sh_o`,
  `cn_v`, `lf_s`, `p_dat`, `s_bit`, `s_byte`, `inb`, `sh_done`, `cn_z`,
