  `l_run`, `l_in`, `l_sp`, `l_pina`, `l_pinb`) — each is another block's output;
* the control registers: the host-write strobes (`c_wr_run`, `c_wr_irqen`,
  `c_wr_db`, `c_wr_hin`, `c_wr_hst`), the picked `FLAGS`/`HOST.OUT` words, the
  host data byte, the `HOST.IN` read bus, `frz`, `rst_q` and the sticky/event
  terms — the host-map, move-resolution, data-RAM and queue cuts cover them;
* the output pins: the `cfg` fields (`obind`, `sel`, `lut`, `oe`), the line
  buses (`l_comm`, `l_pina`, `l_pinb`, `l_seg`), `frz` and `rst_q` — the
  latch-bank and line cuts cover their content.
-/

